# WRMC Recorder

This tool records specific radio shows on WRMC 91.1 FM (Middlebury College) on a Mac. Currently it's tuned to look at the calendar for
two key show names, and it is MacOS specific.

Challenge: WRMC does not keep recordings of its shows. But due to time-zone differences, I often miss my daughter's shows.

This tool records each show from the live stream and saves it as an audio file that you can play later.

