## What the tool does

- **Reads the schedule each day.** At 6:07 am each day, and each time you log in, the Mac reads the WRMC weekly schedule at <https://wrmc.middlebury.edu/schedule-weekly>.
- **Finds Avery's shows.** It finds each show where my daughter is a host. It uses her host tag on the website, so it still finds her shows if a show gets a new name or a new time. Obviously change this tag to your desired show.
- **Sets the recordings.** For each of her shows in the next 8 days, it sets a recording. The recording starts 2 minutes before the show and stops 2 minutes after it.
- **Uses the correct time.** The website gives each show time in New York time with the time zone. The Mac converts it to your local time. Clock changes in the US and the UK do not cause errors.
- **Reminds you 12 hours before.** It adds an item to Apple Reminders (this syncs to your iPhone). It also shows a Mac alert, which can keep the Mac awake until the show ends.
- **Tells you about the next show.** When you run an update yourself, you get a notification with the next show and its time.
- **Tells you when a recording is saved.** You get a notification when each recording is complete.

At the time of writing, the tool watches two shows:

| Show      | Day      | New York time    | UK time (winter) |
| --------- | -------- | ---------------- | ---------------- |
| Trail Mix | Saturday | 9:00 to 10:00 am | 2:00 to 3:00 pm  |
| TAM       | Sunday   | 4:00 to 5:00 pm  | 9:00 to 10:00 pm |

The tool reads the current schedule each day, so you do not need to change anything if these times change.

