## Commands

Type these commands in Terminal.

| Command          | What it does                                                                        |
| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `wrmc next`      | Shows the target's next show and sends a notification.                              |
| `wrmc list`      | Shows all the shows that are set to record.                                         |
| `wrmc update`    | Reads the schedule now, sets recordings and reminders, and tells you the next show. |
| `wrmc test`      | Records 30 seconds now, to make sure that recording works.                          |
| `wrmc uninstall` | Removes all scheduled recordings and reminders, and the daily check.                |

The Mac runs these two commands by itself. You do not need to use them:

| Command                       | What it does                            |
| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| `wrmc record TITLE START END` | Records one show.                       |
| `wrmc remind TITLE START END` | Shows the alert 12 hours before a show. |

