## Settings

To change a setting:

1. Open `~/build/wrmc_recorder/wrmc.py` in a text editor.
2. Change the value near the top of the file, in the "Settings" section.
3. Save the file.
4. Run the installer again: `bash ~/build/wrmc_recorder/install_wrmc_recorder.sh`

| Setting               | Default                                       | What it controls                                                                                                    |
| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `HOST_TAGS`           | `["avery-murch"]`                             | The host tags to find. The tag is the last part of the host link on the schedule page, such as `/tags/avery-murch`. |
| `SHOW_TITLES`         | `[]`                                          | Show names to record, even if the hosts change. Example: `["TAM", "Trail Mix"]`.                                    |
| `START_EARLY_MIN`     | `2`                                           | Minutes to start before the show.                                                                                   |
| `END_LATE_MIN`        | `2`                                           | Minutes to continue after the show.                                                                                 |
| `LOOKAHEAD_DAYS`      | `8`                                           | How many days ahead to set recordings.                                                                              |
| `REMIND_HOURS_BEFORE` | `12`                                          | Hours before the show for the reminder and the Mac alert.                                                           |
| `USE_APPLE_REMINDERS` | `True`                                        | Set to `False` to stop adding items to Apple Reminders. The Mac alert still works.                                  |
| `STREAM_URL`          | `https://us2.maindigitalstream.com/ssl/WRMC`  | The live audio stream.                                                                                              |
| `SCHEDULE_URL`        | `https://wrmc.middlebury.edu/schedule-weekly` | The schedule page.                                                                                                  |

**Note about reminder times:** Trail Mix starts at about 1:00 or 2:00 pm UK time. Thus, a 12-hour reminder comes at about 1:00 or 2:00 am. If you prefer a different time, change `REMIND_HOURS_BEFORE`.

