## Update the tool

If you get a new version of the files:

1. Put the new files in `~/build/wrmc_recorder/`.
2. Run the installer again: `bash ~/build/wrmc_recorder/install_wrmc_recorder.sh`

The installer is safe to run many times. It keeps your recordings, and it does not stop a recording that is in progress.

---

## Remove the tool

1. Type `wrmc uninstall`. This removes all scheduled recordings, all Mac alerts, and the daily check.
2. If you want, also delete these items:
   - `~/Library/Application Support/WRMC/`
   - `~/.local/bin/wrmc`
   - Any items in Reminders that start with "WRMC:"

Your recordings in `~/Music/WRMC/` stay on the Mac. Delete them yourself if you do not want them.

